---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Page not found" description="This address doesn't match a page on softwarden.dev." noindex>
  <section class="wrap nf" aria-labelledby="nf-title">
    <svg class="links" width="120" height="120" viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <path d="M4.5 8.5 10.5 23.5 16 11.5 21.5 23.5 27.5 8.5" stroke="var(--accent-line)" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" fill="none"></path>
      <circle cx="4.5" cy="8.5" r="3.1" fill="var(--accent-line)"></circle>
      <circle cx="10.5" cy="23.5" r="3.1" fill="var(--accent-line)"></circle>
      <circle cx="21.5" cy="23.5" r="3.1" fill="var(--accent-line)"></circle>
      <circle cx="27.5" cy="8.5" r="3.1" fill="var(--accent-line)"></circle>
      <circle cx="16" cy="11.5" r="3.7" fill="var(--chart-2)"></circle>
    </svg>
    <p class="code"><span class="chip gap"><span class="chip-glyph" aria-hidden="true">⚠</span>No page at this address</span></p>
    <h1 id="nf-title">Page not found</h1>
    <p class="lede">The link may be old, or the page may have moved when the docs were reorganized. These are the usual places to go next.</p>
    <ul class="next">
      <li><a href="/">Home</a><span>What Softwarden is and does</span></li>
      <li><a href="/docs/install/">Install guide</a><span>From a fresh VM to a signed-in Admin</span></li>
      <li><a href="/docs/">Documentation</a><span>Every published doc, by topic</span></li>
      <li><a href="/changelog/">Changelog</a><span>What each release contains</span></li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .nf {
    display: grid;
    gap: 18px;
    padding-block: clamp(56px, 10vw, 120px);
    max-width: 760px;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(34px, 4.6vw, 52px);
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1.05;
  }
  .next {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 12px 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .next li {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 4px 16px;
    align-items: baseline;
    padding-block: 12px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .next a {
    font-weight: 600;
    min-width: 150px;
  }
  .next span {
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    font-size: 15px;
  }
</style>
